      "id": "f2018-e2-q05",
      "number": 5,
      "points": 8,
      "stem": "Find the proper form of partial fractions for the following\n\n$$\n\\frac{3x^5 - x + 5}{(x^2 - 2x - 3)(x^2 - 2x + 1)(x^2 + 2x + 5)}\n$$\n\nYou should factor the denominator as much as you can.",
